+  and existing Close behavior. Do not initialize or enable any overhaul module as a fix.
+- All 308 local tests passed (79 Dual Wield tests, 18 suites); Windows release cross-build
+  and PE checks passed. No user crash log or Windows/game execution is available here.
+
 ### 2026-10-30: Stage 348 (Dual Close / Dual Ranged styles)
 - Rename ability 126 to Style: Dual Close; append only disabled Style: Dual Ranged (125).
 - Equipping either style disables the old style in place, preserving native entries/order.
